// moving-out photo would make one idea look like two. Card 2 was the
// library's agency/rent-roll exterior, which was honest but was an exterior
// on a card about vacancy turnarounds; it now uses this folder's own
// handover photo, per IMAGE-PROMPTS.md prompt 3.
